abstract: >
  MouseScope is a modular desktop platform for practical mouse behavioral
  video analysis. The v2.0.0 release supports Tail Suspension Test (TST),
  Open Field Test (OFT), Novel Object Recognition (NOR), Elevated Plus Maze
  (EPM), and Y-Maze inside one unified workflow with calibration, batch
  workspace, result export, and bilingual reporting.
